{"id":"vod_sn_36085","vodId":"36085","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"剑勇传说","name_cn":"剑勇传说","date":"1993-01-01","year":"1993","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/9271460347d52c27135d484e35862f78.jpg"},"summary":"铁剑（高山南 配音）奉父之命潜心钻研剑道，在比赛场上遇见了一生的宿敌鬼丸猛（堀川亮 配音），几番较量之下，鬼丸猛成为了铁剑的手下败将，不甘心的他被风神附体，得到了绝世珍宝风神剑。这边厢，铁剑亦得到了同样拥有强大力量的雷神剑，鬼丸猛一心想要夺走雷神剑，实现自己双剑合璧统治地球的野心，然而却总是不敌铁剑。　　在彻底粉碎了鬼丸猛的阴谋之后，铁剑和一干好友踏上了寻找龙珠的旅途，贼心不死的鬼丸猛自然要从中作梗，派出剑客，阻挠铁剑的队伍。最终，铁剑完成了目标，召唤出了神龙，哪知道神龙的出现使沉寂多年的香姬（深见梨加 配音）横空出世，世界再度落入了危险之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:40:14","playable":true,"episodeCount":52,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YgR8RqUEXe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FCEvyMVFRz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sYD1g6vqu01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/z3K5Cv4CS41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SaBibRudkC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gQxLywvY6v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eLysPaJRqP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rFLwHCrYpf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4W29EySpYa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wXnaV9jm131/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xqpL9TVtqg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2a8Nk7fsWu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xwyBQGx6qe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c4xrd5sADW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https